units           real
dimension       3
boundary        f f f

atom_style      full

pair_style      lj/cut 10.0
bond_style      harmonic
angle_style     harmonic
dihedral_style  zero nocoeff
improper_style  harmonic

read_data ../../phase1B/day041_lammps_export/data.lammps

pair_modify mix arithmetic

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes

thermo_style custom step temp ebond eangle edihed eimp epair etotal press
thermo 1

run 0

min_style cg

min_modify dmax 0.10

thermo_style custom step pe ebond eangle edihed eimp epair fmax
thermo 10

minimize 1.0e-12 1.0e-12 5000 50000
